The two of you may proceed 
to the third game together.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.150
Happily ever after!

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:07.560
Let's go, Yuichi.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:09.310
As long as we're together,

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:13.660
I know we can fight the true darkness 
of this Tomodachi Game.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:14.770
Tenji!

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:15.920
Yuichi!

